From e88e85a2262a7560b9e15a72ebafb0571f29ffd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 10:46:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Phase 1-3 complete - data pipeline, signal score,
 backtest

Phase 1: Data Pipeline
- Binance BTC/USDT daily klines (primary price source)
- 28 on-chain/derivatives datasets from crypto-market-data
- Local cache (parquet + JSON), auto-detect data format
- Unified DataFrame: 1000 rows x 42+ cols, 100% quality

Phase 2: Signal Score (0-100)
- 13 indicators in 4 weighted groups
- 365-day rolling percentile normalization
- Direction mapping (higher_worse/lower_worse/neutral)
- Zones: extreme_fear, fear, neutral, greed, extreme_greed

Phase 3: Walk-Forward Backtest
- 4 strategies: baseline, gated, score-weighted, zone DCA
- 6 walk-forward folds (67 days each)
- All signal strategies outperform baseline (-0.6% to -1.2% vs -1.6%)
- Zone DCA best full period: -6.47% vs baseline -9.05%
